Subject: [PATCH] batch 170 (R29): recalcBlockCounts counting rewrite - flat
 int[paletteSize] count walk (moonrise$countByIndex) + deferred per-ticking-id
 coordinate collection (moonrise$collectIndices) replace per-palette-id
 ShortArrayList materialization (moonrise$countEntries walk was the dominant
 allocation site of the disk-load burst, 354/1,819 JFR trips; consumer only
 needed counts + ticking coords). Counters identical by commutative summation;
 tick list set-identical (uniform random indexing makes order unobservable).
 ZeroBitStorage: all-zero fast path.


